// Base English locale table (roadmap M44; doc 10 §6; doc 06 "LocalizedText").
// Flat key -> template map, loaded via @crowns/data's loadLocaleTable and
// resolved through @crowns/core's Locale — NOT a def kind, so it skips the
// id-based mod-merge pipeline entirely (see packages/data/src/locale.ts).
// Keys mirror the content path that owns them: event.<pool>.<slug>.title /
// .body / .choice.<choiceId>.
