  "event.unrest.rumor-mongering.title": "Rumor Mongering",
  "event.unrest.rumor-mongering.body": "Wild rumors about the kingdom's leadership circulate among the discontented.",
  "event.unrest.rumor-mongering.choice.counter": "Counter the rumors openly",
  "event.unrest.rumor-mongering.choice.ignore": "Ignore it — it'll pass",

  "event.tutorial.welcome.title": "A Word From Your Steward",
  "event.tutorial.welcome.body": "\"Welcome, my liege. Firstholm is founded, but a village is not yet a kingdom. Open the Village and Build panels — grow your population, keep them fed, and the rest follows. I'll check in as things develop.\"",
  "event.tutorial.welcome.choice.ack": "Lead on, Steward.",

  "event.tutorial.economy.title": "The Granaries Are Full",
  "event.tutorial.economy.body": "\"Well fed and growing — your farms are earning their keep. Once wood and stone flow steadily too, look to the Build panel's production chains: sawmills and workshops turn raw goods into finished ones worth more.\"",
  "event.tutorial.economy.choice.ack": "Noted.",

  "event.tutorial.happiness.title": "On Contentment",
  "event.tutorial.happiness.body": "\"Mind your people's joy, my liege — the Village panel shows it plainly. A happy village pays more tax and grows faster; let happiness sink and both curdle. Hover any number you don't trust; I've made sure it explains itself.\"",
  "event.tutorial.happiness.choice.ack": "I'll keep watch.",

  "event.tutorial.tax.title": "The Weight of the Crown's Due",
  "event.tutorial.tax.body": "\"The tax rate in the Village panel is your sharpest lever — and your riskiest. Raise it and the treasury swells today, but joy bleeds daily, and a punitive rate eventually taxes itself into poverty. Moderation compounds; greed doesn't.\"",
  "event.tutorial.tax.choice.ack": "A fair warning.",

  "event.tutorial.edicts.title": "Edicts of the Realm",
  "event.tutorial.edicts.body": "\"The treasury can bear an edict now, if you'd enact one from the Kingdom panel — each is a standing bonus with a daily upkeep, plain in its ledger line. Hover one to see exactly what it changes; nothing in this court hides its numbers.\"",
  "event.tutorial.edicts.choice.ack": "Show me the ledger.",

  "event.tutorial.complete.title": "A Kingdom, Not Just a Village",
  "event.tutorial.complete.body": "\"Tier two, my liege — fed, sheltered, and built up on your own judgment. That's a stable, growing kingdom by any Steward's reckoning. Everything from here is the same craft at a larger scale. Well governed.\"",
  "event.tutorial.complete.choice.ack": "Onward.",
}
